          }
        ],
        "text": "(Police station—night.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s068-u002",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "போலீஸ்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s068-d001",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 84,
            "printedPage": 76
          }
        ],
        "text": "Stones were thrown at the police!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s068-u003",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "II போலீஸ்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s068-d002",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 84,
            "printedPage": 76
          }
        ],
        "text": "They smashed the mill gate to pieces. They threw stones at the mill owner's house too.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s068-u004",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "போலீஸ்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s068-d003",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 84,
            "printedPage": 76
          }
        ],
        "text": "People are afraid even to move about in the street.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s068-u005",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "போலீஸ்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s068-d004",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 84,
            "printedPage": 76
          }
        ],
        "text": "They say there's going to be a big procession tomorrow morning.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s068-u006",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "சப்- இன்ஸ்பெக்டர்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s068-d005",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 84,
            "printedPage": 76
          }
        ],
        "text": "(Entering.) All right. Orders have come to arrest the leading figures. Move out!",
        "notes": []
      }
    ]
  }
